          "line_id": "legacy/line/8355a97601cc/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8355a97601cc/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "text": "本區防衛隊立刻開始防衛行動,交戰並殲滅敵目標。"
